# Shopify Listing Generator — Project Rules

## Tech Stack
Tauri v2 (Rust) + React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 + Vite + Zustand

## Conventions
- TypeScript strict mode, KHÔNG dùng `any`
- Functional components + hooks only
- PascalCase: components | camelCase: functions/variables | kebab-case: filenames
- Absolute imports via `@/`
- Tailwind utility classes only, KHÔNG custom CSS trừ bắt buộc
- Rust: snake_case theo convention chuẩn

## Shopify CSV — 57 CỘT (theo file thực tế của store)
Handle | Title | Body (HTML) | Vendor | Product Category | Type | Tags | Published
| Option1 Name | Option1 Value | Option1 Linked To | Option2 Name | Option2 Value
| Option2 Linked To | Option3 Name | Option3 Value | Option3 Linked To | Variant SKU
| Variant Grams | Variant Inventory Tracker | Variant Inventory Policy
| Variant Fulfillment Service | Variant Price | Variant Compare At Price
| Variant Requires Shipping | Variant Taxable | Unit Price Total Measure
| Unit Price Total Measure Unit | Unit Price Base Measure | Unit Price Base Measure Unit
| Variant Barcode | Image Src | Image Position | Image Alt Text | Gift Card | SEO Title
| SEO Description | Clean Title (product.metafields.custom.clean_title)
| Last Sold Date (product.metafields.custom.last_sold_date)
| Product rating count (product.metafields.reviews.rating_count)
| Activity (product.metafields.shopify.activity)
| Age group (product.metafields.shopify.age-group)
| Closure type (product.metafields.shopify.closure-type)
| Color (product.metafields.shopify.color-pattern)
| Footwear material (product.metafields.shopify.footwear-material)
| Heel height type (product.metafields.shopify.heel-height-type)
| Occasion style (product.metafields.shopify.occasion-style)
| Shoe features (product.metafields.shopify.shoe-features)
| Shoe size (product.metafields.shopify.shoe-size)
| Sneaker style (product.metafields.shopify.sneaker-style)
| Target gender (product.metafields.shopify.target-gender)
| Toe style (product.metafields.shopify.toe-style)
| Variant Image | Variant Weight Unit | Variant Tax Code | Cost per item | Status

## CSV Row Rules
- Dòng 1 (product): Điền ĐẦY ĐỦ tất cả cột product-level + variant đầu tiên
- Dòng 2+ (variants): Chỉ Handle + Option Values + Variant fields + Image. Cột product-level TRỐNG.
- Dòng image-only: Handle + Image Src + Image Position. Tất cả cột khác TRỐNG.
- Handle dùng chung cho toàn bộ variants + image rows của cùng 1 product.

## Image Matching Rule
Tên file ảnh trên Drive PHẢI chứa CẢ Option1 Value (Style) VÀ Option2 Value (Player).
Ví dụ: Option1 Value = "College Navy", Option2 Value = "Sam Darnold-14"
→ File phải có tên chứa "college navy" + "sam darnold" (case-insensitive, bỏ số jersey)
Nếu không match → đánh dấu warning, để user chọn thủ công.
